      "deferred_scope": "Factions have differentiated resources/actions, exact knowledge gates, relationship feedback, and material autonomous effects. Production world arcs route queued person/state/polity/House/institution priorities into one-shot owner work; queued work gives no arc momentum until the owning domain settles evidence. Interstate theaters are infrastructure and require saved war intent or a severe threat/claim/diplomatic basis rather than inevitable pressure. Dynamic polities can negotiate alliances, nonaggression, tribute, access, guarantees, and client-state proposals through routed target consent. Hostage/marriage diplomacy, negotiated territorial exchange, reparations bargaining, coalition conferences, and full court procedures remain deferred."
